{"title":"Rimewing","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 43 Moth that attacks with stab (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/moonwing-dust\">Moonwing Dust</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/rimewing\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rimewing?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>11</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rimewing?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>23</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rimewing?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>20</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rimewing?lv=43\" title=\"Pick level 43\"><td><b>43</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>11</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rimewing?lv=57\" title=\"Pick level 57\"><td><b>57</b></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>23</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rimewing?lv=58\" title=\"Pick level 58\"><td><b>58</b></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td>20</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 4 recorded drops, 730 total, 176–185 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×176–185</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"luna-wing\" title=\"Luna Wing - in 2 of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 9 total, 4–5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9dfc6bd97d5a343b2a88.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Luna Wing</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×4–5</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"moth-silk\" title=\"Moth Silk - in 2 of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 6 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/0d15d8530734f756ad4c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Moth Silk</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-head\" title=\"Ogrewax Head - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/05a82e7c1a7ef24524df.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Flawless: 1 of 1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+5 more\">+5 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gravewrap-torso\" title=\"Gravewrap Torso - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/612eb1b2115c7c63ce78.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gravewrap Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"glimmerfox-legs\" title=\"Glimmerfox Legs - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/6b40824883ae40cc9159.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glimmerfox Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gravewrap-arms\" title=\"Gravewrap Arms - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/12067670c90381512ea9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gravewrap Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-arms\" title=\"Dragonscale Arms - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/01655d6cc28367cce40f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Moonfane</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 54</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6104\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Moth: <a href=\"#/monster/moonfane-moth\">Moonfane Moth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(39)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/luna-moth\">Luna Moth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/lantern-eater\">Lantern-Eater</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/great-luna-moth\">Great Luna Moth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(42)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/moon-mother\">Mother of Moths</a> <span class=\"muted\">(45)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/fa1caff6f6abd7b79a09.svg\" alt=\"Rimewing\"></div><h3>Rimewing</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>43 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 43–58)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Moth</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · ranged</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>222</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>28.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2150</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>2.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>5</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>4 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}